# review fixes: zeta near 0 (not through zeta(1 - s)), complex beta where
# only Gamma(a + b) has a pole or the factors overflow, negative orders
# beyond the degree, gamma's pole at a complex number, Hurwitz's pole,
# calls that become float calls after a substitution
t('zeta(1e-14)', lambda: r(zeta(1e-14)))
t('zeta(-1e-14)', lambda: r(zeta(-1e-14)))
